<section id="areas" class="bg-surface px-5 py-8 md:px-30 md:py-14"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:gap-14"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 md:w-[500px] md:gap-3.5"><p class="font-medium text-[10px] md:text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.15em] md:tracking-[0.16em] text-accent">SERVICE AREA</p><h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[25px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.16] md:leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.005em] max-w-[54rem]">Thirty miles of Portland. We turn down everything past it.</h2><p class="text-[15px] md:text-[16.5px] leading-[1.62] text-ink-soft">A two-hour window we cannot actually hit is worth nothing to you, so we do not sell one. If you are outside the radius we will say so on the phone and point you at someone closer.</p></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap content-start gap-2.5"><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Portland — all quadrants</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Beaverton</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Hillsboro</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Tigard</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Lake Oswego</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Gresham</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Milwaukie</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Tualatin</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">West Linn</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Oregon City</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Happy Valley</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Clackamas</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Vancouver WA</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Wilsonville</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Sherwood</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Forest Grove</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Aloha</span><span class="rounded-full border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Cedar Mill</span></div></div></section>
